---
const title = 'Pricing & Scope | USIVA';
const description = 'A plain-language guide to USIVA scope: no public price list, no payment request on this page, and no promise of an immigration result.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/pricing.html';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://usiva.org/assets/usiva-social.svg" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="USIVA — visa-readiness and compliance planning" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#122f48" />
  </head>
  <body class="pricing-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="price-bar"><div class="price-wrap"><span>Scope before spend.</span><a href="/contacts.html">Prepare a careful question →</a></div></div>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="price-wrap header-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="USIVA home"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">US</span><span><strong>USIVA</strong><small>U.S. Immigration &amp; Visa Association</small></span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/pricing.html" aria-current="page">Scope &amp; fees</a><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a><a class="nav-cta" href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a></nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="price-hero">
        <div class="price-wrap price-hero__grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--gold">Pricing / a transparent answer</p>
            <h1>No public price list is published here.</h1>
            <p class="hero-lede">USIVA public pages describe visa-readiness and compliance-planning questions. They do not create a fee quote, a service contract, or a promise that a pathway is available.</p>
            <div class="actions"><a class="button button--gold" href="/contacts.html">Ask for scope</a><a class="button button--outline" href="/services.html">See what planning covers</a></div>
          </div>
          <aside class="price-card" aria-label="Scope note"><span class="card-index">01 / Scope first</span><strong>The right number depends on the actual question.</strong><p>Stage, documents, location, provider, timing, and the authority responsible for the decision all matter. Confirm those details directly before paying anyone.</p></aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="scope-heading">
        <div class="price-wrap">
          <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What this page can establish</p><h2 id="scope-heading">A scope conversation has four useful edges.</h2><p>The bands below are planning categories, not a menu of guaranteed services or fixed-price packages.</p></div>
          <div class="scope-table">
            <div class="scope-row scope-row--head"><span>Planning edge</span><span>Question to clarify</span><span>What remains outside this page</span></div>
            <div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-name"><b>01</b> Orientation</span><span>What stage am I in, and which decision is actually next?</span><span>Eligibility, adjudication, or an individualized legal opinion.</span></div>
            <div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-name"><b>02</b> Document map</span><span>Which records, translations, dates, or instructions should I gather and verify?</span><span>A guarantee that a packet is complete or accepted.</span></div>
            <div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-name"><b>03</b> Pathway conversation</span><span>Which school, sponsor, program, or government source owns the next answer?</span><span>Authority to issue a visa, status, employment authorization, or approval.</span></div>
            <div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-name"><b>04</b> Specialist handoff</span><span>What personal facts make licensed advice the responsible next step?</span><span>Representation, filing, or legal work by an unnamed provider.</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="payment-heading">
        <div class="price-wrap payment-grid">
          <div class="payment-stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>Before</span><strong>PAY</strong><span>pause + verify</span></div>
          <div class="payment-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Before any payment</p><h2 id="payment-heading">Ask for the terms in writing.</h2><p>A careful scope note should let you identify who is providing the work, what the reader will receive, what is not included, which dates and sources matter, and where individualized legal questions must go.</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Name the provider.</strong><p>Do not infer a relationship from a logo, a referral, or a public planning page.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Name the deliverable.</strong><p>Ask whether the work is education, document organization, a consultation, a filing service, or something else.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Name the boundary.</strong><p>Confirm what the provider cannot decide and which official instruction controls the next action.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Name the next check.</strong><p>Rules, school instructions, sponsor requirements, and fees can change; ask when the information was last verified.</p></div></li></ol></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="questions-heading">
        <div class="price-wrap question-grid">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">Questions worth carrying</p><h2 id="questions-heading">A price is not the same thing as a result.</h2><p>Use these prompts to keep a commercial conversation separate from an immigration decision.</p></div>
          <div class="questions">
            <details open><summary>Does a payment guarantee admission or a visa?</summary><p>No. USIVA does not promise admission, employment, funding, visa issuance, or government approval. Any provider should state its own scope without implying control over an outside decision.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can a planning page tell me whether I qualify?</summary><p>General information can help you identify questions. A personal eligibility analysis belongs with the school, sponsor, government source, or licensed immigration attorney responsible for the matter.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Why is there no number on this page?</summary><p>There is no published USIVA price list in this public site. A responsible amount, if any, requires a real scope and direct confirmation of the provider and terms.</p></details>
            <details><summary>What should I do if a claim sounds too certain?</summary><p>Ask for the source, the date checked, the person or institution that controls the decision, and the written terms. Pause before sending money or beginning an activity you do not understand.</p></details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="scope-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
        <div class="price-wrap scope-cta__inner"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">A low-risk next step</p><h2 id="cta-heading">Start with the question you need priced or verified.</h2><p>No payment is requested on this page. Prepare a short brief, then confirm the right destination.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button button--gold" href="/contacts.html">Draft the brief</a><a class="button button--light" href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">View the US Fellows pathway ↗</a></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="notice"><div class="price-wrap"><strong>Important notice:</strong> This page is informational planning content, not a quote or legal advice. It does not guarantee admission, employment, funding, visa issuance, or government approval.</div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="price-wrap footer-grid"><div><a class="footer-brand" href="/">USIVA</a><p>Visa-readiness and compliance planning for international study and research pathways.</p></div><div><p class="footer-label">Explore</p><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About USIVA</a><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">Questions</p><a href="/tips-faq.html">Tips &amp; FAQ</a><a href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a><a href="/other-pages.html">Route atlas</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">Notice</p><p>Verify current instructions and terms with the authority or provider responsible for your situation.</p></div></div><div class="price-wrap footer-bottom">© 2026 USIVA · A US Council companion site.</div></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #fbfaf7; color: #172231; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  :global(a:focus-visible), :global(summary:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #d5af62; outline-offset: 4px; }
  :global(p) { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #5c6974; }
  :global(h1), :global(h2), :global(h3) { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: #0a253f; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; }
  :global(h1) { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.3vw, 7rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  :global(h2) { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.3vw, 4.3rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  :global(h3) { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .price-wrap { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -4rem; left: 1rem; z-index: 20; padding: .7rem 1rem; background: #fff; color: #0a253f; font-weight: 800; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }
  .price-bar { background: #071827; color: #e0e9ed; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .price-bar .price-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding-block: .55rem; }
  .price-bar a { color: #f0d798; font-weight: 850; }
  .site-header { background: #fbfaf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dfe1; }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; min-height: 5.6rem; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; }
  .mark { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #0a253f; font: 700 .8rem Georgia, serif; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #fbfaf7, inset 0 0 0 5px #b9893e; }
  .brand strong { display: block; color: #0a253f; font: 700 1.5rem/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .brand small { display: block; color: #52616a; font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .3rem 1.25rem; color: #334350; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 750; }
  nav a:hover, nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: #ae403a; }
  .nav-cta { padding: .55rem .8rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; color: #ae403a; }
  .price-hero { background: #122f48; color: #fff; }
  .price-hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(18rem, .85fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); align-items: end; min-height: 40rem; padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 9rem) clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .price-hero h1 { max-width: 54rem; color: #fff; }
  .eyebrow, .card-index, .footer-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ae403a; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eyebrow--gold, .eyebrow--light { color: #efd69b; }
  .hero-lede { max-width: 45rem; color: #d7e3e8; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.5; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3rem; padding: .75rem 1.05rem; border: 1px solid #c39a4c; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .button--gold { background: #c39a4c; color: #071827; }
  .button--outline { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); color: #fff; }
  .button--light { background: #fff; border-color: #fff; color: #0a253f; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .price-card { padding: 1.8rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-top: 5px solid #c39a4c; background: #0b253b; box-shadow: 1rem 1rem 0 rgba(0,0,0,.13); }
  .price-card .card-index { color: #efd69b; }
  .price-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #fff; font: 600 clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.6rem)/1.08 Georgia, serif; }
  .price-card p { color: #c6d6dc; font-size: .92rem; }
  .section { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); }
  .section--paper { background: #f2ede4; border-block: 1px solid #e0d9cd; }
  .section-head { max-width: 52rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .section-head > p:last-child { max-width: 42rem; font-size: 1.06rem; }
  .scope-table { border-top: 1px solid #bfcbd0; }
  .scope-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, .7fr) minmax(14rem, 1.1fr) minmax(13rem, .9fr); gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.35rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #bfcbd0; }
  .scope-row--head { color: #6d7a82; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .scope-row > span:not(.scope-name) { color: #52636d; font-size: .93rem; }
  .scope-name { color: #0a253f; font-weight: 850; }
  .scope-name b { display: inline-block; width: 2.2rem; color: #ae403a; font: 700 .75rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .payment-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, .4fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 9rem); align-items: start; }
  .payment-stamp { display: grid; width: 12rem; height: 12rem; place-content: center; gap: .2rem; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #ae403a; text-align: center; transform: rotate(-7deg); }
  .payment-stamp span { font: 700 .7rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .payment-stamp strong { color: #0a253f; font: 700 2.35rem Georgia, serif; }
  .payment-copy { max-width: 52rem; }
  .payment-copy > p { font-size: 1.06rem; }
  .payment-copy ol { list-style: none; margin: 2rem 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c4cecf; }
  .payment-copy li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr; gap: .8rem; padding: 1.1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #c4cecf; }
  .payment-copy li > span { color: #ae403a; font: 700 .75rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .payment-copy li strong { color: #0a253f; }
  .payment-copy li p { margin: .2rem 0 0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .question-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); align-items: start; }
  .question-grid > div:first-child { max-width: 29rem; }
  .questions { border-top: 1px solid #c4cecf; }
  details { border-bottom: 1px solid #c4cecf; }
  summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.2rem 0; cursor: pointer; color: #0a253f; font: 600 1.2rem Georgia, serif; list-style: none; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after { content: "+"; color: #ae403a; font: 400 1.4rem Inter, sans-serif; }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "–"; }
  details p { max-width: 45rem; padding: 0 2rem 1rem 0; font-size: .95rem; }
  .scope-cta { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); background: #0b5f5a; color: #fff; }
  .scope-cta__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; }
  .scope-cta h2 { color: #fff; }
  .scope-cta p { color: #d6e7e4; }
  .scope-cta .actions { margin-top: 0; }
  .notice { padding-block: 1.2rem; background: #f8e7be; color: #36280e; font-size: .88rem; }
  .site-footer { padding-block: 4rem 1.5rem; background: #0b2238; color: #cad7df; }
  .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .7fr .8fr 1.1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-brand { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: .8rem; color: #fff; font: 700 1.55rem Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .site-footer p { color: #b5c5cf; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a { display: block; margin: .35rem 0; color: #d9e4e9; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a:hover { color: #f0d798; }
  .footer-label { margin-bottom: .7rem; color: #efd69b; }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #8ea3b0; font-size: .78rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding-block: 1rem; }
    nav { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .price-hero__grid, .payment-grid, .question-grid, .scope-cta__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .price-hero__grid { min-height: auto; }
    .price-card { max-width: 34rem; }
    .scope-cta .actions { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .price-wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1160px); }
    .price-bar .price-wrap { display: block; }
    .price-bar a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .3rem; }
    .scope-row, .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .45rem; }
    .scope-row--head { display: none; }
    .scope-row { padding-block: 1.2rem; }
    .scope-row > span:not(.scope-name)::before { content: "↳ "; color: #ae403a; }
    .payment-stamp { width: 9.5rem; height: 9.5rem; }
    .actions .button { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; } .button:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
